TITLE Albite kinetic dissolution with H2S gas at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    redox     pe
    units     mmol/kgw
    Fe(2)     4
    Fe(3)     4
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g)    5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -ionic_strength true
END
